# Self-contained server + prod node_modules produced by `pnpm deploy` for
# bundling into the desktop app (see apps/desktop/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json's
# beforeBuildCommand). .gitkeep stays tracked so `cargo check`/`cargo test`
# in apps/desktop/src-tauri don't fail validating the bundle.resources glob
# on a fresh checkout that's never run `tauri build`/the deploy step.
apps/desktop/src-tauri/server-bundle/*
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/server-bundle/.gitkeep
